{"id":"10-restaurangen","level":"A1","title":{"sv":"På restaurangen","en":"At the restaurant","zh":"在餐厅"},"scene":{"en":"Li and Erik order dinner and ask for the bill.","zh":"Li 和 Erik 点晚餐，然后要账单。"},"vocab":[{"sv":"boka bord","en":"to book a table","zh":"订位子"},{"sv":"köttbullar","en":"meatballs","zh":"肉丸"},{"sv":"potatismos","en":"mashed potatoes","zh":"土豆泥"},{"sv":"dagens","en":"today's (dish of the day)","zh":"今日特餐"},{"sv":"nota","en":"bill (in a restaurant)","zh":"账单"},{"sv":"var för sig","en":"separately","zh":"分开（付）"}],"lines":[{"who":"Servitör","sv":"Hej och välkomna! Har ni bokat bord?","en":"Hello and welcome! Have you booked a table?","zh":"你们好，欢迎！订位了吗？","tokens":[{"t":"Hej","id":1162},{"t":" "},{"t":"och","id":87},{"t":" "},{"t":"välkomna","id":2106},{"t":"! "},{"t":"Har","id":90},{"t":" "},{"t":"ni","id":233},{"t":" "},{"t":"bokat","id":2625},{"t":" "},{"t":"bord","id":1482},{"t":"?"}],"note":{"en":"“Välkomna” is the plural of “välkommen”.","zh":"“välkomna” 是“välkommen”的复数。"},"audio":"audio/10-restaurangen/01.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Ja, ett bord för två, på namnet Li.","en":"Yes, a table for two, under the name Li.","zh":"订了，两个人，名字是 Li。","tokens":[{"t":"Ja","id":350},{"t":", "},{"t":"ett","id":93},{"t":" "},{"t":"bord","id":1482},{"t":" "},{"t":"för","id":98},{"t":" "},{"t":"två","id":77},{"t":", "},{"t":"på","id":95},{"t":" "},{"t":"namnet","id":368},{"t":" "},{"t":"Li"},{"t":"."}],"audio":"audio/10-restaurangen/02.mp3"},{"who":"Servitör","sv":"Här är menyn. Vill ni ha något att dricka?","en":"Here's the menu. Would you like something to drink?","zh":"这是菜单。要喝点什么吗？","tokens":[{"t":"Här","id":180},{"t":" "},{"t":"är","id":88},{"t":" "},{"t":"menyn","id":4777},{"t":". "},{"t":"Vill","id":129},{"t":" "},{"t":"ni","id":233},{"t":" "},{"t":"ha","id":90},{"t":" "},{"t":"något","id":135},{"t":" "},{"t":"att","id":99},{"t":" "},{"t":"dricka","id":1280},{"t":"?"}],"audio":"audio/10-restaurangen/03.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Ett glas rött vin, tack.","en":"A glass of red wine, please.","zh":"一杯红酒，谢谢。","tokens":[{"t":"Ett","id":93},{"t":" "},{"t":"glas","id":2568},{"t":" "},{"t":"rött","id":932},{"t":" "},{"t":"vin","id":2036},{"t":", "},{"t":"tack","id":903},{"t":"."}],"note":{"en":"No “of”: ett glas vin, en kopp kaffe, en flaska vatten.","zh":"不用“of”：ett glas vin（一杯酒）、en kopp kaffe（一杯咖啡）、en flaska vatten（一瓶水）。"},"audio":"audio/10-restaurangen/04.mp3"},{"who":"Erik","sv":"Och en öl till mig.","en":"And a beer for me.","zh":"我要一杯啤酒。","tokens":[{"t":"Och","id":87},{"t":" "},{"t":"en","id":93},{"t":" "},{"t":"öl","id":2611},{"t":" "},{"t":"till","id":105},{"t":" "},{"t":"mig","id":158},{"t":"."}],"audio":"audio/10-restaurangen/05.mp3"},{"who":"Servitör","sv":"Är ni redo att beställa?","en":"Are you ready to order?","zh":"可以点餐了吗？","tokens":[{"t":"Är","id":88},{"t":" "},{"t":"ni","id":233},{"t":" "},{"t":"redo","id":2713},{"t":" "},{"t":"att","id":99},{"t":" "},{"t":"beställa","id":1889},{"t":"?"}],"audio":"audio/10-restaurangen/06.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Ja. Jag tar köttbullar med potatismos.","en":"Yes. I'll have the meatballs with mashed potatoes.","zh":"可以。我要肉丸配土豆泥。","tokens":[{"t":"Ja","id":350},{"t":". "},{"t":"Jag","id":102},{"t":" "},{"t":"tar","id":137},{"t":" "},{"t":"köttbullar","v":"köttbullar"},{"t":" "},{"t":"med","id":104},{"t":" "},{"t":"potatismos","v":"potatismos"},{"t":"."}],"note":{"en":"“Jag tar …” (I take …) is how you order.","zh":"点餐说“Jag tar …”（我要……）。"},"audio":"audio/10-restaurangen/07.mp3"},{"who":"Erik","sv":"Jag tar dagens fisk. Innehåller den nötter? Jag är allergisk.","en":"I'll have the fish of the day. Does it contain nuts? I'm allergic.","zh":"我要今日鲜鱼。里面有坚果吗？我过敏。","tokens":[{"t":"Jag","id":102},{"t":" "},{"t":"tar","id":137},{"t":" "},{"t":"dagens","v":"dagens"},{"t":" "},{"t":"fisk","id":1701},{"t":". "},{"t":"Innehåller","id":707},{"t":" "},{"t":"den","id":107},{"t":" "},{"t":"nötter","id":7625},{"t":"? "},{"t":"Jag","id":102},{"t":" "},{"t":"är","id":88},{"t":" "},{"t":"allergisk","id":7022},{"t":".